{"title":"Career Roadmap · Competition Law Associate","role":"Competition Law Associate","summary":"A Competition Law Associate advises companies, investors and other organizations on laws designed to promote fair competition and prevent anti-competitive conduct.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Competition Law / Securities Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Competition Law Associate advises companies, investors and other organizations on laws designed to promote fair competition and prevent anti-competitive conduct."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Commercial law"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"M&A"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Securities-market awareness"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Regulatory proceedings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition-law research"},{"text":"Merger and acquisition analysis"},{"text":"Competition compliance"},{"text":"Market-definition analysis"},{"text":"Abuse-of-dominance matters"},{"text":"Cartel and anti-competitive agreement analysis"},{"text":"Regulatory filings"},{"text":"Competition investigations"},{"text":"Legal opinions"},{"text":"Competition litigation and appeals"},{"text":"Transaction due diligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Because the specialization includes Competition Law / Securities Law, the student can also develop complementary knowledge of capital markets, securities regulation, listed companies and financial-market compliance."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB","Competition + Corporate + Securities Law","Competition Law Internship","Legal Research / Regulatory Associate","Competition Law Associate","Senior Competition Law Associate","Competition Law Specialist / Counsel","Partner / Senior Legal Counsel"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Corporate / M&A","Competition Law","Antitrust / Regulatory Practice","Competition Counsel"]}]},{"heading":"Major Areas of Competition Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Competition Law Associate should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Anti-Competitive Agreements"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cartels"},{"text":"Price fixing"},{"text":"Bid rigging"},{"text":"Market allocation"},{"text":"Output restrictions"},{"text":"Information exchange"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Abuse of Dominant Position"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Predatory pricing"},{"text":"Unfair pricing"},{"text":"Exclusive arrangements"},{"text":"Refusal to deal"},{"text":"Discriminatory conduct"},{"text":"Tying and bundling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mergers & Acquisitions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merger review"},{"text":"Acquisition analysis"},{"text":"Combination assessment"},{"text":"Market concentration"},{"text":"Competitive effects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Competition Compliance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition policies"},{"text":"Employee training"},{"text":"Dawn-raid preparedness"},{"text":"Compliance audits"},{"text":"Risk assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Proceedings"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Notices"},{"text":"Responses"},{"text":"Regulatory submissions"},{"text":"Appeals"}]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Constitutional Law"},{"text":"Law of Torts"},{"text":"Jurisprudence"},{"text":"Legal Methods"},{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Criminal Law"},{"text":"Property Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Companies"},{"text":"Markets"},{"text":"Businesses"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Consumers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Corporate & Commercial Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Companies"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"M&A fundamentals"},{"text":"Corporate transactions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sale of goods"},{"text":"Agency"},{"text":"Partnership"},{"text":"Commercial contracts"},{"text":"Business structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Securities Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Capital markets"},{"text":"Shares"},{"text":"Debt securities"},{"text":"Public offerings"},{"text":"Stock exchanges"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Investor protection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Competition Law Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Competition Concepts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relevant market"},{"text":"Product market"},{"text":"Geographic market"},{"text":"Market power"},{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Barriers to entry"},{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Consumer welfare"},{"text":"Competitive harm"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Anti-Competitive Agreements"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Conduct","Agreement / Coordination?","Competitive Effect","Relevant Market","Potential Harm","Legal Assessment"]},{"type":"h","text":"Cartels"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Price fixing"},{"text":"Bid rigging"},{"text":"Market sharing"},{"text":"Output restriction"},{"text":"Collusion"},{"text":"Information exchange"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Advanced Competition Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dominance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market position"},{"text":"Entry barriers"},{"text":"Customer dependence"},{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Pricing practices"},{"text":"Exclusionary conduct"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M&A Competition Analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Transaction","Identify Relevant Markets","Market Shares","Competitor Analysis","Entry Barriers","Competitive Effects","Regulatory Thresholds","Filing / Legal Strategy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Competition Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition compliance policies"},{"text":"Training programmes"},{"text":"Risk assessments"},{"text":"Internal investigations"},{"text":"Compliance checklists"}]}]},{"heading":"Economics for Competition Lawyers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Competition law is heavily connected with economics."},{"type":"p","text":"A law student should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply and demand"},{"text":"Price elasticity"},{"text":"Marginal cost"},{"text":"Average cost"},{"text":"Market structure"},{"text":"Consumer surplus"},{"text":"Producer surplus"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Market Structures"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perfect competition"},{"text":"Monopoly"},{"text":"Oligopoly"},{"text":"Monopolistic competition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Competition Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market concentration"},{"text":"Barriers to entry"},{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Switching costs"},{"text":"Economies of scale"},{"text":"Vertical integration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student does not need to become a professional economist, but should be comfortable working with economic evidence."}]},{"heading":"Market Definition","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important competition-law skills is defining the relevant market."},{"type":"h","text":"Product Market"},{"type":"p","text":"Ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"Which products or services are sufficiently substitutable?"},{"type":"h","text":"Geographic Market"},{"type":"p","text":"Ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"In which geographic area do competitive conditions remain sufficiently similar?"},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Potential Substitutes","Customer Behaviour","Geographic Scope","Relevant Market"]}]},{"heading":"Market Power Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After identifying the relevant market, examine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Competitor strength"},{"text":"Entry barriers"},{"text":"Buyer power"},{"text":"Supplier power"},{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Switching costs"},{"text":"Access to technology"},{"text":"Distribution control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Competitive Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Market Share"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Entry Barriers"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Competitor Strength"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Customer Dependence"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Network Effects","Market Power Assessment"]}]},{"heading":"M&A / Combination Review","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Competition lawyers frequently support corporate transactions."},{"type":"p","text":"The process can include:"}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the transaction."}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Identify relevant markets."}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Collect market information."}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Assess competitive overlap."}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate potential competitive effects."}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Determine whether regulatory filing or engagement may be required."}]},{"heading":"Details","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prepare legal analysis and supporting documentation."},{"type":"p","text":"The exact filing thresholds and procedures should always be checked against the applicable current competition regime and transaction facts."}]},{"heading":"Securities Law Integration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Since the specialization includes Securities Law, the student should also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities markets"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Public offerings"},{"text":"Insider trading"},{"text":"Market manipulation"},{"text":"Disclosure obligations"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Investor protection"},{"text":"Takeovers"},{"text":"Securities intermediaries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Complementary Knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Securities Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Competition Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["M&A","Corporate Regulatory Practice"]},{"type":"p","text":"This combination is especially useful for lawyers working on large corporate transactions."}]},{"heading":"Competition Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Companies need systems to prevent employees from engaging in anti-competitive conduct."},{"type":"p","text":"A compliance programme may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition policy"},{"text":"Employee training"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Distributor guidelines"},{"text":"Sales-team guidance"},{"text":"Trade-association guidance"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Reporting channels"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Cycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Identify Risk","Create Policy","Train Employees","Monitor Conduct","Investigate Issues","Corrective Action","Continuous Review"]}]},{"heading":"Dawn-Raid / Investigation Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Competition regulators may conduct investigations according to applicable legal procedures."},{"type":"p","text":"A Competition Associate should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search/investigation procedures"},{"text":"Document preservation"},{"text":"Legal privilege concepts"},{"text":"Employee guidance"},{"text":"Regulator interaction"},{"text":"Evidence management"},{"text":"Internal investigation procedures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The lawyer should work with the organization's investigation team and ensure that employees understand lawful cooperation and document-handling requirements."}]},{"heading":"Competition Litigation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory proceedings"},{"text":"Investigation responses"},{"text":"Written submissions"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Expert economic evidence"},{"text":"Appeals"},{"text":"Judicial review"},{"text":"Competition tribunals/courts as applicable"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Case Strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Allegation","Facts & Evidence","Relevant Market","Economic Analysis","Legal Analysis","Defence / Response","Regulatory Proceeding","Appeal if Required"]}]},{"heading":"Legal Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Competition Associate should research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition statutes"},{"text":"Regulations"},{"text":"Regulatory orders"},{"text":"Competition authority decisions"},{"text":"Tribunal/court decisions"},{"text":"International competition developments"},{"text":"Economic studies"},{"text":"Market reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Question","Identify Applicable Competition Rule","Primary Legal Sources","Regulatory Decisions","Case Law","Economic Evidence","Competitive Analysis","Legal Opinion"]}]},{"heading":"Data & Economic Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Competition law increasingly requires quantitative analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful skills:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Market-share calculations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market-share dashboards"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Pricing trends"},{"text":"Market concentration"},{"text":"Transaction analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Percentage changes"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Trend analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced competition matters may involve economists and specialized economic models; the lawyer should be able to understand and critically assess their conclusions."}]},{"heading":"AI in Competition Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case classification"},{"text":"Decision summaries"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Legal-document analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M&A"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help organize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transaction documents"},{"text":"Market information"},{"text":"Competitor information"},{"text":"Due-diligence materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help identify patterns in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Pricing data"},{"text":"Communications"},{"text":"Compliance records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI Analysis","Source Verification","Economic / Legal Review","Human Judgment","Final Advice"]},{"type":"p","text":"Sensitive investigation documents and privileged material should only be processed through approved systems with appropriate confidentiality and security controls."}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Market Definition Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose an industry and analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relevant product market"},{"text":"Geographic market"},{"text":"Substitutes"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Entry barriers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Competition Risk Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical company compliance assessment."},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pricing practices"},{"text":"Distributor agreements"},{"text":"Competitor interactions"},{"text":"Trade associations"},{"text":"Information exchange"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — M&A Competition Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze a hypothetical acquisition."},{"type":"p","text":"Acquirer"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Target","Market Overlap","Competitor Analysis","Market Share","Entry Barriers","Competitive Effects","Regulatory Assessment"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Competition Law Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI/Excel dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market participants"},{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Competitive concentration"},{"text":"Major transactions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Securities & Competition Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze how a major corporate transaction can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M&A law"},{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Securities regulation"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Corporate law firm"},{"text":"General litigation/research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition law firm"},{"text":"Corporate/M&A law firm"},{"text":"Securities law practice"},{"text":"Regulatory organization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition-law practice"},{"text":"Economic consulting firm"},{"text":"Corporate legal department"},{"text":"Competition compliance team"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideal internships:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition law team"},{"text":"M&A regulatory practice"},{"text":"Competition authority/regulatory environment where eligible"},{"text":"Corporate regulatory team"},{"text":"Economic consulting firm"},{"text":"Competition-policy think tank"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Student Should Demonstrate"],"rows":[[{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Strong doctrinal knowledge"}],[{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Relevant-market methodology"}],[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Basic competition economics"}],[{"text":"M&A"},{"text":"Transaction understanding"}],[{"text":"Securities"},{"text":"Capital-market fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Regulatory + case-law research"}],[{"text":"Drafting"},{"text":"Legal opinions and submissions"}],[{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Competition compliance"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel + quantitative analysis"}],[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Commercial/regulatory negotiation"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Responsible legal research"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Clear business/legal advice"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Competition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Antitrust"},{"text":"Competition economics"},{"text":"M&A regulation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Securities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Capital markets"},{"text":"Securities regulation"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Financial markets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"M&A fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Legal technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, practical case analysis and economics knowledge generally add more value than collecting unrelated certificates."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Legal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LL.M Competition Law"},{"text":"LL.M Corporate Law"},{"text":"LL.M Business Law"},{"text":"LL.M Securities Law"},{"text":"LL.M Corporate & Commercial Law"},{"text":"LL.M Regulatory Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Economics / Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master's in Economics"},{"text":"Competition Economics"},{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"Regulatory Policy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"MBA Strategy"},{"text":"MBA Business Management"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Antitrust Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition investigations"},{"text":"Appeals"},{"text":"Regulatory proceedings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. M&A Competition"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merger review"},{"text":"Transaction strategy"},{"text":"Regulatory filings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Competition Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate compliance"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Risk assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Digital Competition"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital platforms"},{"text":"Big Tech"},{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Data-driven markets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Securities & Competition"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"M&A"},{"text":"Capital markets"},{"text":"Corporate transactions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Competition Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market studies"},{"text":"Quantitative analysis"},{"text":"Economic evidence"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition Law Intern"},{"text":"Legal Research Associate"},{"text":"Junior Competition Associate"},{"text":"Regulatory Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition Law Associate"},{"text":"Antitrust Associate"},{"text":"Competition Compliance Associate"},{"text":"M&A Regulatory Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Competition Law Associate"},{"text":"Competition Counsel"},{"text":"Competition Compliance Manager"},{"text":"Senior Regulatory Counsel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8+ Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competition Law Partner"},{"text":"Head of Competition"},{"text":"Senior Competition Counsel"},{"text":"Chief Regulatory Counsel"}]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Digital Competition"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology platforms create new competition-law questions involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Data advantages"},{"text":"Platform dependency"},{"text":"Self-preferencing"},{"text":"Algorithmic pricing"},{"text":"Digital ecosystems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Competition"},{"type":"p","text":"Emerging questions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algorithmic coordination"},{"text":"AI-driven pricing"},{"text":"Access to compute"},{"text":"Data advantages"},{"text":"AI market concentration"},{"text":"Platform power"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech & Securities"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology is also transforming:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trading"},{"text":"Digital finance"},{"text":"Market infrastructure"},{"text":"Automated investment services"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["These developments make the combination of competition","securities","technology regulation particularly valuable."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand competition-law principles"},{"text":"Analyze anti-competitive agreements"},{"text":"Understand dominance issues"},{"text":"Conduct basic relevant-market analysis"},{"text":"Understand M&A competition issues"},{"text":"Understand securities-market fundamentals"},{"text":"Perform regulatory research"},{"text":"Analyze competition authority decisions"},{"text":"Understand competition compliance"},{"text":"Work with economic and market data"},{"text":"Use Excel and Power BI"},{"text":"Draft legal research memoranda"},{"text":"Prepare competition-risk assessments"},{"text":"Understand digital-platform competition"},{"text":"Use AI responsibly for legal research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Competition Law Research Paper"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant Market Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"M&A Competition Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Competition Compliance Checklist"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Competition Risk Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Market-Share Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Securities / M&A Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"2–3 Competition / Corporate Internships"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"COMPETITION LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"CORPORATE LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"M&A"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SECURITIES LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"COMPETITION ECONOMICS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"MARKET ANALYSIS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"REGULATORY RESEARCH"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"COMPETITION COMPLIANCE"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"LEGAL DRAFTING"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"DATA ANALYTICS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"EXCEL + POWER BI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"DIGITAL COMPETITION"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-ASSISTED LEGAL RESEARCH"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"BUSINESS COMMUNICATION"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Competition-law professional combining antitrust expertise, corporate/M&A knowledge, securities awareness, economic analysis and regulatory strategy.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop the ability to connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Conduct","Market","Economic Effects","Competition Risk","Legal Analysis","Regulatory Strategy"]},{"type":"p","text":"For an AI-era career, adding digital competition, platform economics, data-driven markets and algorithmic pricing can create a particularly strong specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Career-Fitment Mapping Note"},{"type":"p","text":"Competition Law Associate is a specialized legal career requiring strong analytical and economic reasoning in addition to legal knowledge. Because the row combines Competition Law / Securities Law, students should build competition expertise first while developing securities and M&A knowledge as a complementary corporate-regulatory skill set. Actual regulatory filing thresholds, procedures and enforcement frameworks can change, so practitioners must always verify the current rules applicable to the transaction or conduct being analyzed."}]}]}